OL,3,GNEWSALondon pollution warning after fog
OL,4,Aand fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA high air pollution alert for the
OL,7,Fcapital has been issued by the mayor of
OL,8,FLondon after a weekend of dense fog and
OL,9,Ffireworks.
OL,11,FForecasters at Imperial College London
OL,12,Fadvised Lord Sadiq Khan to trigger the
OL,13,Falert after "dense fog and very light
OL,14,Fwinds allowed pollution to build up",
OL,15,Faccording to the mayor's office.
OL,17,FIt said smoke from Bonfire Night and
OL,18,FDiwali fireworks "is likely to have
OL,19,Fcontributed".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
