OL,3,GNEWSALondon pollution warning after fog
OL,4,Aand fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondoners have been warned to "look
OL,7,Fafter themselves" as high levels of
OL,8,Fparticle pollution are forecast. They
OL,9,Fhave also been advised to walk, cycle
OL,10,Fand use public transport more
OL,11,Ffrequently, drive less and avoid
OL,12,Funnecessary burning at home.
